274	    /**
275	     * Whether the owner was flagged as a possible (soft) duplicate at creation time — not a hard
276	     * duplicate, but sharing an existing owner's last name and postcode with a different telephone.
277	     * A {@code null} stored value is treated as {@code false}, so the field is always present in the
278	     * response.
279	     */
